@title Print preview: actions in view, thumbnails drawn, print opens the preview
@area Reports
# C-31 and C-32: Save PDF stays visible, thumbnails show the sheets, Ctrl+K print opens the preview.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 5
text print
wait 10
shot print-palette
key enter
wait 30
expect "Print preview and plot sets"
expect "Save PDF"
expect "Save every plot set"
expect "Design checks as a last page"
shot print-preview
check_layout
